 port of the QMesh growable cache: quant K/V and QSA plane pools reserved as
 CUDA virtual ranges, physical pages mapped in 2 MiB granules as the page
 table hands pages out (lowest unbacked page first, no defrag); adaptive
 prefill limiter on a growable pool counts only device-free memory (torch
 cache released first) and steps planned/8192/4096/2048

